# A backend function that calls ops (increment 4), for the upgrade
# continuity fixture, version 1. Put beside `functions.ordo` only when this
# build applies the program: a previous Ordo before increment 4 refuses
# `uses`, so the Ordo upgrade first applies version 1 without it.
#
# `jot` writes a journal entry with `writeJournal` and counts the caller's
# entries with `myJournal`, both as the person calling. Version 1.1 changes
# its code.

function jot in upgrade {
  call($body: text) -> json by member
  code "fn/jot.js"
  uses writeJournal, myJournal
}
